  "body": "## Purpose\n\nBegin the Chairman-authorized Sovereign Auction and Funding Pressure Intelligence program under Macro #6819 and the existing Rates / Inflation Command workstream. Current official APIs cannot be treated as historical announcement vintages, and deterministic auction importance must remain separate from predictive risk.\n\n## This checkpoint\n\n- Recover the exact source, ownership, competing PR paths and prior null-study constraints.\n- Freeze a disjoint first vertical: immutable official observations projected as `sovereign_auction_context` inside the existing event-calendar feed.\n- Record Treasury API migration, amended deadlines, CUSIP aliases and point-in-time requirements.\n\nImplementation and the complete research adjudication are in progress on this same branch. This initial commit contains the source census only.\n\n## Ownership and exclusions\n\nPreserve held PRs #7273, #7320 and #8241, plus #7022 and #7949 ownership. No changes to those branches, their holds, risk/exit authority, deployment, or paid-data rights. Preserve SLF-006 NO-GO, D2 auction-cycle FAIL and Terminal exit-modulation KILL.\n\n## Verification at this checkpoint\n\n- Base: `d2eec4732abee359ebb578b245fa7359b3c01a7d`.\n- Census commit: `298d0b64a5665b1179086190eaa925452b77d4ef`.\n- Clean acquired workspace; `git diff --check`; exact pushed-head readback.\n- Runtime / production / consumer acceptance: not claimed.\n\n**Draft / HOLD. No merge or deployment requested.**",
